   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi All.<div><br></div><div>I read in a tree that was the consensus tree from MrBayes in .nwk format. </div><div>The problem is when I load it into the global environment, I clearly see only the edge, Nnode, tip.label and edge.length.</div><div><br></div><div>Any idea on how to make my post. prob values appear? If I view the same tree in FigTree, I can see the prob values when I select &quot;prob&quot; under Node Labels column.</div><div><br></div><div>Suggestions?</div><div><br></div><div>vijay</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
